#: lib/tymeslot_saas_web/live/about_live.ex:200
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "So we put our time into the parts other tools skip over: the themes, the typography, the way a page loads and moves, the video backgrounds. Getting the booking logic right is the easy bit. Making the whole thing <span class=\"text-primary font-semibold\">look good</span> is what actually takes the work."
msgstr ""

